    "chunk_text": "Petrus sylfa him s\u00e6de, \u00fe\u00e6t hine sylfne gestode & he s\u00e6de, \u00fe\u00e6t sona swa he w\u00e6re of \u00feam lichaman atogen, \u00fe\u00e6t he gesawe helle witu & & eac he cy\u00f0de, \u00fe\u00e6t he gesawe sume \u00fea rican men \u00feissere worulde, & hi w\u00e6ron ahangene in \u00feam Eac swylce he andette, \u00fe\u00e6t he w\u00e6re sylf \u00feider gel\u00e6ded, to \u00feon \u00fe\u00e6t he sceolde \u00fe\u00e6r inne beon \u00dea f\u00e6ringa \u00e6teowde Godes \u00e6ngcel \u00fe\u00e6r mid swi\u00f0e wlitigre ansyne, se styrde, \u00fe\u00e6t man hine in \u00dea sona \u00e6fter \u00fe\u00e6re stefne \u00fe\u00e6s \u00e6ngles geheortlice him w\u00e6ron \u00fea limu cwiciende & f\u00e6gre. & he \u00f0a onwoc fram \u00feam sl\u00e6pe \u00fe\u00e6s ecan dea\u00f0es & sona s\u00e6de ealle \u00fea wisan, \u00fee ymb hine Witodlice \u00feam w\u00e6s gedon mid \u00fey dea\u00f0e for \u00fe\u00e6s \u00e6lmihtigan Godes \u00fe\u00e6re wundorlican Ac so\u00f0lice seo \u00e6teownes \u00feara wita ne by\u00fe na gelice nyt eallum mannum, for\u00feon \u00fee seo Witodlice se forem\u00e6ra wer Stephanus, \u00feone \u00feu canst genoh g\u00e6re, se me s\u00e6de be him sylfum, \u00dea becom him on his lichaman mettrymnes, o\u00f0 \u00fe\u00e6t he wear\u00f0 for\u00f0fered. \u00dea sona w\u00e6s soht, hw\u00e6r se l\u00e6ce w\u00e6re, \u00fee cu\u00fee wyrtgemang wyrcan, \u00fe\u00e6t se mihte hine \u00dea \u00fey d\u00e6ge ne mihte nan l\u00e6ce beon funden, ac \u00fey \u00e6fterfylgendan nihte \u00fe\u00e6t lic l\u00e6g unbebyrged. & he",
